# ─── Keeper Secrets Manager credential ───────────────────────────────────────
# There is NO environment variable for the Keeper bound configuration, and no
# env fallback anywhere in this service (SOP §3.1). Every tool call must carry
# its own tenant's credential in the X-Keeper-Config HTTP header instead — see
# README.md § Authentication headers. This is intentional: a shared env
# credential would break per-tenant isolation in a multi-tenant deployment.

# ─── MCP HTTP server ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MCP_HTTP_HOST=0.0.0.0
MCP_HTTP_PORT=8080
